<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: (Amalgamate) membrane inside -->
  <MembraneAmalgamate.label>（融合）表膜</MembraneAmalgamate.label>
  <!-- EN: Inside amalgamation is where the predator reversibly absorbs the prey into\n            themselves
  for indefinite storage. -->
  <MembraneAmalgamate.description>体内融合是一种捕食方式：捕食者将猎物可逆地吸收进自身体内，进行无限期储存。</MembraneAmalgamate.description>
  <!-- EN: {0} will meld {1} into themselves for storage -->
  <MembraneAmalgamate.actionDescription>{0}将把{1}融合进体内进行储存</MembraneAmalgamate.actionDescription>
  <!-- EN: Membrane vore -->
  <MembraneAmalgamate.RMBLabel>表膜吞噬</MembraneAmalgamate.RMBLabel>

  <!-- EN: (Assimilate) membrane inside -->
  <MembraneAssimilate.label>（同化）表膜</MembraneAssimilate.label>
  <!-- EN: Inside assimilation is where the predator permanently absorbs the prey into\n            themslves,
  feeding the predator -->
  <MembraneAssimilate.description>体内同化是一种捕食方式：捕食者将猎物永久性地吸收进自身体内，以此滋养自身。</MembraneAssimilate.description>
  <!-- EN: {0} will assimilate {1} into themslves -->
  <MembraneAssimilate.actionDescription>{0}将把{1}同化进自身体内</MembraneAssimilate.actionDescription>
  <!-- EN: Membrane vore -->
  <MembraneAssimilate.RMBLabel>表膜吞噬</MembraneAssimilate.RMBLabel>

  <!-- EN: (Heal) membrane inside -->
  <MembraneHeal.label>（治愈）表膜</MembraneHeal.label>
  <!-- EN: Healing vore will tend to a pawns wounds and slowly heal their damaged body\n            parts.
  Healing vore is relatively weak, so if you want to treat a pawn properly, use\n            medicine and a
  good doctor. -->
  <MembraneHeal.description>治愈吞噬会处理角色的伤口，并缓慢修复其受损的身体部位。治愈吞噬的效果相对有限，若想妥善治疗，还是用药和好医生更靠谱。</MembraneHeal.description>
  <!-- EN: {PREDATOR} will heal {PREY} in themselves. -->
  <MembraneHeal.actionDescription>{PREDATOR}将在体内治愈{PREY}</MembraneHeal.actionDescription>
  <!-- EN: Membrane vore -->
  <MembraneHeal.RMBLabel>表膜吞噬</MembraneHeal.RMBLabel>

  <!-- EN: (Reform) membrane inside -->
  <MembraneReform.label>（重塑）表膜</MembraneReform.label>
  <!-- EN: Reformation creates a new pawn inheriting attributes from both original prey\n            and
  predator -->
  <MembraneReform.description>体内重塑会创造出一个全新的角色，继承原猎物和捕食者双方的属性。</MembraneReform.description>
  <!-- EN: {PREDATOR} will reform {PREY} inside of them -->
  <MembraneReform.actionDescription>{PREDATOR}将在体内重塑{PREY}</MembraneReform.actionDescription>
  <!-- EN: Membrane vore -->
  <MembraneReform.RMBLabel>表膜吞噬</MembraneReform.RMBLabel>

</LanguageData>